          "audioUrl": "https://academy.linguistic-communication.com/api/classroom-media/lan110_module_09/audio/tts_s4_action_lan110_module_09_quiz_intro.mp3",
          "voice": "Sonia Neural (Edge TTS, en-GB, professional classroom narration)"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_lan110_module_09_quiz_feedback",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "The correct answer is A. Revenue and expenses may be recognized before cash is received or paid. Late collections, inventory, and supplier timing can create liquidity pressure.",
